AB  - The traditional method of artificial identification of ornamental fish species is cumbersome and inefficient, and the accuracy of data cannot be guaranteed. With the development of science and technology, the application of deep learning technology on mobile devices can help us quickly identify ornamental fish species through this method. The machine learning model was built through the VGG16 deep learning network and converted into a Tensorflow Lite model with a high recognition rate. After that, it was deployed to the iOS APP to identify ornamental fish species. At the same time, we have also realized the function of the ornamental fish knowledge base. This software has important practical significance for popularizing the knowledge of ornamental fish. © 2022 IEEE.
