AB  - Intelligent mobile phone operating system is more and more widely used in smart home area which brings great convenience for people's lives. On this basis, this paper studies the application of intelligent operating system based on iOS (iPhone Operating System) in home heating management service. This system uses MVC (Model View Controller) design mode based on the C/S (Client/Server) architecture. iOS mobile terminals use asynchronous socket communication based on TCP/IP (Transmission Control Protocol/Internet Protocol) to perform data interaction with the server of heating company. Real-time and humanized management can be realized by the intelligent operations, such as news view, controlling valves, etc. The test results indicate that the application can satisfy the requirements of home heating services and demonstrate user-friendliness and scalability. ©, 2015, Binary Information Press. All right reserved.
